  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PFPPA 2021-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing GBV and sexual repoductive health right violations among youth and women in Palestine project main goal is Palestinian wome and youth live free of GBV, with their sexual and reporductive health and rights fullfilled. the projects aims to acheive the following outcome : 
contibute to polcieis and decison to respect and protect SRHR and gender equity are modifed, issued and implmented, 
increase number of people that make well infomared decision and choices regarding their SRHR 
increase number of rights based high quality integrated SRH services accessible and provided. 
project output: enhance commitment of policy and decison makers to apply modified decison and policies related SRHR. 
improved young people access to cimprehansive CSE both inside and outside schools. 
strengthen the involvoment of media , opinion leaders, metworks and other partners promoting SRH of schools. 
Enhance access to SRH high quality ,rights based integrated service. 
increase access to SRH services through other health providers and partners-</narrative>
  </description>
